      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORANA AMY (6) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (18.88) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start can clear the tricky draw. Can turn form around here. LEON BONKERS (2) jumps from box 2 for the first time after placing latest at this track (19.25) in a Maiden. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Speedy beginner who should be prominent early on from an inside box. Expected to be in this for a long way. MIA ON POINTE (1) has not raced since scoring (20.43) over 340m at Gunnedah 11 weeks ago. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. JUST A GLANCE (4) can sneak into the finish again.",
